<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae to present '96 results March 17.</title>
<headline>Sonae to present '96 results March 17.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese industrial group Sonae Investimentos expects to present its 1996 results on March 17, an official source in the company told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
